values
  (216, 'Changes to slice 4.1 after an independent review, before it merged. Jobs belong to the workspace in `SLACK_WORKSPACE_ID`; without it, capture still runs as before 4.1, unlogged, and a warning is logged hourly. A job is due once per calendar minute of its interval, however long reconcile''s earlier steps took. A capture wake''s cost is its own calls'' only. A wake left unfinished for ten minutes is ended as failed ("did not finish"), not read as silent. A briefs run that fails as a whole is a failed wake. Capture''s cap is 31 days of its daily budget when the job is made; raising the budget later needs the cap raised too (4.2). Silent wakes are pruned hourly, with an index for it', 'The review found that capture stopped without the workspace variable, that two overlapping wakes counted each other''s spend, that a killed wake read as silent for ever, that a failed briefs run was logged as silent, and that a five-second margin skipped minutes when reconcile ran long. Each now has a test', 'active', 'the owner', '2026-11-26T00:00:00Z', 'import', '216')
on conflict (origin, origin_ref) where origin_ref is not null do nothing;
